WEBVTT

00:23:55.324 --> 00:24:01.246
where it attracts the young generation, 
entrepreneurs, innovators

00:24:01.246 --> 00:24:04.535
into trying to really 
take their ideas into action.

00:24:04.535 --> 00:24:06.945
And I think that relationship with TED

00:24:06.945 --> 00:24:10.874
comes as part of that sequence, 
that work the Foundation is doing

00:24:11.136 --> 00:24:17.050
from not only trying to increase 
the publication in Arabic,

00:24:17.050 --> 00:24:19.172
which we do in HBKU Press,

00:24:19.172 --> 00:24:20.520
through "Stars of Science" -

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:23.230
where we are really promoting 
that young generation

00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:26.542
to really bring their ideas 
and be more innovative -

00:24:26.542 --> 00:24:30.126
but also coming into a platform 
where we are taking